  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Tenu: Permet à Tyranocif de Méga-Évoluer en Méga-Tyranocif.",
      "short_effect": "Tenu: Permet à Tyranocif de Méga-Évoluer en Méga-Tyranocif.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Held: Allows Tyranitar to Mega Evolve into Mega Tyranitar.",
      "short_effect": "Held: Allows Tyranitar to Mega Evolve into Mega Tyranitar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "バンギラスに　もたせておくと\nたたかいのとき　メガシンカが　できる\nふしぎな　メガストーンの　いっしゅ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "마기라스에게 지니게 하면\n배틀할 때 메가진화할 수 있는\n신비한 메가스톤의 일종.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une variété de Méga-Gemme.\nTenue par un Tyranocif, elle lui permet de\nméga-évoluer durant un combat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Einer der mysteriösen Mega-Steine. Wird er von\neinem Despotar getragen, kann es im Kampf eine\nMega-Entwicklung durchführen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si la lleva un Pokémon, aumenta su Defensa\nEspecial tras recibir un ataque especial.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un esemplare delle misteriose Megapietre.\nData a Tyranitar, gli permette di megaevolversi\ndurante la lotta.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One variety of the mysterious Mega Stones.\nHave Tyranitar hold it, and this stone will\nenable it to Mega Evolve during battle.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "バンギラスに　持たせておくと\n戦いのとき　メガシンカが　できる\n不思議な　メガストーンの　一種。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
